<title>USA: CONSENSUS: U.S. corporate earnings surprise data.</title>
<headline>CONSENSUS: U.S. corporate earnings surprise data.</headline>
<text>
<p>Earnings surprise for December 2, provided by Zacks Investment Research. The following companies reported the greatest deviations, above or below analysts' mean estimates, as compiled by Zacks.</p>
<p>COMPANY		   ESTIMATE  ACTUAL  PCT SURPRISE</p>
<p>CENTRAL MAINE	    -0.30     0.04	113.33%</p>
<p>WILEY (JOHN) A	    0.13     0.21	 61.54%</p>
<p>ARBATAX INTL		0.30     0.38	 26.67%</p>
<p>NORRELL CORP		0.26     0.28	  7.69%</p>
<p>SUPREME INTL CORP	 0.44     0.45	  2.27%</p>
<p>JTS CORP		   -0.08    -0.15	-87.50%</p>
<p>THOR INDUSTRIES	   0.63     0.59	 -6.35%</p>
<p>BOB EVANS FARMS	   0.24     0.23	 -4.17%</p>
</text>
